# Godot from its release, patched below, built by SCons with Dolly's cc on a
# platform of Dolly's own (platform/dolly, from demos/godot/platform): the
# engine with GDScript, 2D and 3D and Godot's own physics for both, the
# fallback text server, Ogg Vorbis, MP3, WebP and regular expressions, what an
# exported game loads; its Mobile and Forward+ renderers on gpu@0 where the
# browser grants WebGPU, and its Compatibility renderer on Mesa's OpenGL (EGL
# and softpipe, linked in from mesa-build) where it does not, with its sound on
# audio@0. It plays on the page or runs a project with --headless.
FROM /demos/ghostty-gtk/Dollyfile-mesa-build 048aa453e05bc51a213c1bc725eb12502772f6823aacbe4cc73ab06ddd78b6d7
